ons. Now on the run with his companions, Noctis begins to work towards defeating the forces of Niflheim and rescuing the crystal from their control.", "summary": "Play as Noctis, the Crown Prince of the Kingdom of Lucis, as you seek to reclaim your homeland from the imperial army. With your closest friends along for the ride, you\u2019ll travel through the breath-taking world of Eos, encountering larger-than-life beasts and unforgiving enemies. Face thrilling combat as you learn to master your weaponry and magic skills by channeling the power of your ancestors.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/final-fantasy-xv", "videos": [{"id": 10736, "name": "Death Spell Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "q5S6PKUjxBI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q5S6PKUjxBI", "title": "Final Fantasy XV - Death Spell Gameplay Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/q5S6PKUjxBI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 3213, "name": "Walkthrough video", "video_id": "5FtyVC58cIo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5FtyVC58cIo", "title": "Final Fantasy XV - Walkthrough video (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5FtyVC58cIo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 8635, "name": "E3 2016 Trailer", "video_id": "hmzMjzw51uU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hmzMjzw51uU", "title": "Final Fantasy XV - E3 2016 Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hmzMjzw51uU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 9506, "name": "52 minute Gameplay video (Official)", "video_id": "8Iq0zyu_ldk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8Iq0zyu_ldk", "title": "Final Fantasy XV - 52 minute Gameplay video (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8Iq0zyu_ldk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 15590, "name": "PC Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "DOSUw0vxhuM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D